       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZPS15A.
      * COUNTS ITS CALLS FOR ZP115A (>>CALLINTERFACE).
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  COUNTER-NUM PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  ANSWER-NUM PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ANSWER-NUM.
           ADD 1 TO COUNTER-NUM.
           MOVE COUNTER-NUM TO ANSWER-NUM.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ZPS15A.
